Scenario 2 – ARP Table Analysis (Smart Home Network)

Objective
To verify network connectivity using ping and observe ARP table entries.

 Steps Performed
- Opened PC0 and Server1 Command Prompt.
- Executed `arp -a` to view the ARP table.
- Pinged all devices from PC0:
  - Door (192.168.1.10)
  - Window (192.168.1.12)
  - Server1 (192.168.1.1)
  - Webcam (192.168.1.16)
  - Webcam1 (192.168.1.13)
  - Fan (192.168.1.14)
- Verified all ping responses were successful.
- Rechecked the ARP table after communication.

Result
All devices responded successfully (0% packet loss). The ARP table contained the IP-to-MAC address mappings, confirming the network is working correctly.
